### Base: container mapped to localhost:8080

### HelloController
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hello
Accept: application/json

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/demo
Accept: application/json


### TodoController - GET all todos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Accept: application/json


### TodoController - POST create todo (success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Học Spring Boot",
  "completed": false,
  "steps": [
    { "items": "Tạo project", "completed": true },
    { "items": "Viết API CRUD", "completed": false }
  ]
}


### TodoController - POST create todo (title empty -> 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "completed": false
}


### TodoController - POST create todo (step items empty -> 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Todo with bad step",
  "steps": [
    { "items": "", "completed": false }
  ]
}


### TodoController - PATCH update todo title
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Todo Title"
}


### TodoController - PATCH mark todo as completed
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}


### TodoController - PATCH todo not found (404)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Test"
}


### TodoStep - PATCH update step (items + completed)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "text": "Updated Step",
  "completed": true
}


### TodoStep - PATCH update step not found (404)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/items/999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "text": "X"
}


### TodoStep - PATCH validation (empty text -> 400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "text": ""
}


### TodoStep - DELETE step
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/items/1
Accept: application/json


### TodoStep - DELETE step not found (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/items/999
Accept: application/json


### TodoController - DELETE todo
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/1
Accept: application/json


### TodoController - DELETE todo not found (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todos/999
Accept: application/json


### AIController - POST voice-to-text (success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/voice-to-text
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "audioBase64": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA=",
  "audioFormat": "wav"
}


### AIController - POST voice-to-text (with mp3 format)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/voice-to-text
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "audioBase64": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA=",
  "audioFormat": "mp3"
}


### AIController - POST voice-to-text (empty audioBase64 -> 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/voice-to-text
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "audioBase64": "",
  "audioFormat": "mp3"
}


### AIController - POST voice-to-text (missing audioBase64 -> 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/voice-to-text
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "audioFormat": "mp3"
}


### AIController - POST generate-tasks (success - shopping list)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/generate-tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Thêm danh sách đi chợ để nấu món bò sốt vang"
}


### AIController - POST generate-tasks (success - task with steps)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/generate-tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Tạo kế hoạch học Spring Boot trong 1 tuần"
}


### AIController - POST generate-tasks (empty prompt -> 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/generate-tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "prompt": ""
}


### AIController - POST generate-tasks (missing prompt -> 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/generate-tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
}